#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The traders weigh their silver on small scales: a broken piece of a bracelet buys as much as a "
"coin of the same weight."
msgstr ""
"Die Händler wiegen ihr Silber auf kleinen Waagen: Ein Stück von einem zerbrochenen Armreif kauft "
"so viel wie eine Münze, die gleich viel wiegt."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The combs of antler are so precious that people are buried with them."
msgstr "Kämme aus Geweih sind so kostbar, dass man die Menschen mit ihnen begräbt."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The vikings make their sails of wool; it takes a weaver a whole year to weave a big one."
msgstr ""
"Die Wikinger machen ihre Segel aus Wolle; eine Weberin braucht ein ganzes Jahr, um ein großes zu "
"weben."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey is the only sweet the vikings know, so the bees are worth a lot."
msgstr "Honig ist die einzige Süßigkeit, die die Wikinger kennen, darum sind die Bienen viel wert."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The runes are carved in straight lines, so that they are easy to cut in wood and stone."
msgstr ""
"Die Runen bestehen aus geraden Strichen, damit man sie leicht in Holz und Stein ritzen kann."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "In winter, the lakes freeze, and people travel on skates made of horse bones."
msgstr "Im Winter frieren die Seen zu, und die Leute reisen auf Schlittschuhen aus Pferdeknochen."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Women hold the keys of the house: a woman with keys on her belt runs the farm."
msgstr ""
"Die Frauen tragen die Schlüssel des Hauses: Eine Frau mit Schlüsseln am Gürtel führt den Hof."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The vikings give their boats names, like Long Serpent or Sea Horse."
msgstr "Die Wikinger geben ihren Booten Namen, wie Lange Schlange oder Seepferd."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cats on the farms catch the mice in the grain stores, so everybody loves them."
msgstr "Die Katzen auf den Höfen fangen die Mäuse in den Kornspeichern, darum haben alle sie lieb."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good horse is worth more than a whole boatload of fish."
msgstr "Ein gutes Pferd ist mehr wert als eine ganze Bootsladung Fisch."

