#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/004_the_sneezing_sheep/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our sheep sneezes and sneezes. Row to the island of Laxön and ask Tova the healer what helps."
msgstr ""
"Unser Schaf niest und niest. {crew|Rudere|Rudere|Rudert} zur Insel Laxön und "
"{crew|frag|frag|fragt} Tova, die Heilerin, was hilft."

