#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every night, a pot of honey is gone from my hives! Who takes it? Ask Old Halvard the ferryman, he "
"sees everything on the lakes."
msgstr ""
"Jede Nacht fehlt ein Topf Honig bei meinen Bienenstöcken! Wer nimmt ihn? {crew|Frag|Frag|Fragt} "
"den alten Fährmann Halvard, er sieht alles auf den Seen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey? Ha! I saw paw prints on the shore by Svanetorp. Small ones. Ask Old Grim there."
msgstr ""
"Honig? Ha! Ich habe Pfotenabdrücke am Ufer bei Svanetorp gesehen. Kleine. {crew|Frag|Frag|Fragt} "
"dort den alten Grim."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Paw prints? Look in my woodshed... a bear cub, sticky with honey! His mother must be in the woods "
"by Hjortingsala. Take him to her, gently."
msgstr ""
"Pfotenabdrücke? {crew|Schau|Schau|Schaut} mal in meinen Holzschuppen ... ein Bärenjunges, ganz "
"klebrig vom Honig! Seine Mutter ist bestimmt im Wald bei Hjortingsala. {crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} "
"es zu ihr, ganz sanft."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "He is asleep in the basket. Row quietly!"
msgstr "Es schläft im Korb. {crew|Rudere|Rudere|Rudert} leise!"

