msgid "The Foal Is Coming"
msgstr "Das Fohlen kommt"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/013_the_foal_is_coming/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My mare Silke is about to foal, and she is restless. Please fetch Tova from Laxön, quickly! Tova "
"takes the room of a crate in your boat."
msgstr ""
"Meine Stute Silke bekommt bald ihr Fohlen, und sie ist unruhig. {crew|Hol|Hol|Holt} bitte Tova aus"
" Laxön, schnell! Tova braucht in {crew|deinem|deinem|eurem} Boot so viel Platz wie eine Kiste."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/013_the_foal_is_coming/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A foal? I come at once. Let me sit in the bow."
msgstr "Ein Fohlen? Ich komme sofort. Ich setze mich vorn in den Bug."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/013_the_foal_is_coming/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A little filly, with white socks! She stands already. When she is grown, she is yours: I promise."
msgstr ""
"Ein kleines Stutfohlen mit weißen Socken! Es steht schon. Wenn es groß ist, gehört es "
"{crew|dir|dir|euch}: Das verspreche ich."

