#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Market Day"
msgstr "Der Markttag"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The great market day is soon! The first trader with new honey and goat's cheese gets the best "
"place. Gunnhild from the Long Lake wants it too. Can you beat her?"
msgstr ""
"Bald ist der große Markttag! Wer als Erster neuen Honig und Ziegenkäse bringt, bekommt den besten "
"Platz. Gunnhild vom Langen See will ihn auch. {crew|Schaffst du|Schaffst du|Schafft ihr} es vor "
"ihr?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Two crates of honey! Now the cheese."
msgstr "Zwei Kisten Honig! Jetzt den Käse."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Honey and cheese, and before Gunnhild! She laughs and says: next time I win. I think you two will "
"be friends."
msgstr ""
"Honig und Käse, und noch vor Gunnhild! Sie lacht und sagt: Nächstes Mal gewinne ich. Ich glaube, "
"{crew|ihr zwei werdet Freunde|ihr zwei werdet Freundinnen|ihr werdet Freunde|ihr werdet "
"Freundinnen}."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/014_the_market_day/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "On market days, traders came from far away; the best stalls went to the first."
msgstr "Auf Markttagen kamen Händler von weit her; die besten Stände bekamen die Ersten."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Sick Calf"
msgstr "Das kranke Kalb"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The calf of our cow does not drink. Tova says she needs chamomile and a warm stone in her bed. The"
" chamomile is with Tova, the stones are hot in Dagny's kiln on Bergö."
msgstr ""
"Das Kalb unserer Kuh trinkt nicht. Tova sagt, es braucht Kamille und einen warmen Stein in seinem "
"Bett. Die Kamille hat Tova, und die Steine liegen heiß in Dagnys Brennofen auf Bergö."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Chamomile calms her tummy. Give it with warm water."
msgstr "Kamille beruhigt sein Bäuchlein. {crew|Gib|Gib|Gebt} sie ihm mit warmem Wasser."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hot from the kiln, wrapped in wool. It stays warm all night."
msgstr "Heiß aus dem Ofen, in Wolle gewickelt. Er bleibt die ganze Nacht warm."

