#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/017_midsummer_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Midsummer night at my hall! We need two crates of mead, and garlands of flowers from Solby for the"
" maypole. Come yourselves, in your new dresses!"
msgstr ""
"Mittsommernacht in meiner Halle! Wir brauchen zwei Kisten Met und Blumenkränze aus Solby für den "
"Mittsommerbaum. {crew|Komm|Komm|Kommt} selbst, in {crew|deinem neuen Gewand|deinem neuen "
"Kleid|euren neuen Gewändern|euren neuen Kleidern}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/017_midsummer_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead for the feast! Now the garlands."
msgstr "Met für das Fest! Jetzt die Kränze."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/017_midsummer_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We wove them all morning. They smell of summer!"
msgstr "Wir haben den ganzen Morgen geflochten. Sie duften nach Sommer!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/017_midsummer_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The garlands are up, the torches are lit, and everybody dances around the pole! Uncle Sven sings "
"too loud. What a night!"
msgstr ""
"Die Kränze hängen, die Fackeln brennen, und alle tanzen um den Baum! Onkel Sven singt zu laut. Was"
" für eine Nacht!"

