msgid "The Foal Comes Home"
msgstr "Das Fohlen kommt heim"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/021_the_foal_comes_home/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Silke's filly is big enough now, and the stable is ready. Take her home! She is nervous on the "
"water: make room in the boat, and row gently."
msgstr ""
"Silkes Stutfohlen ist jetzt groß genug, und der Stall ist fertig. {crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} es "
"nach Hause! Auf dem Wasser ist es ängstlich: {crew|mach|mach|macht} Platz im Boot und "
"{crew|rudere|rudere|rudert} sanft."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/021_the_foal_comes_home/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "There, little one, stand still. Row gently, girls!"
msgstr ""
"So, Kleines, halt still. {crew|Rudere|Rudere|Rudert} sanft, {crew|mein Junge|mein Mädchen|ihr "
"zwei|ihr Mädchen}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/021_the_foal_comes_home/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She trots into the new stable and sniffs the hay. Your first horse! What will you call her?"
msgstr ""
"Es trabt in den neuen Stall und schnuppert am Heu. {crew|Dein|Dein|Euer} erstes Pferd! Wie "
"{crew|willst du|willst du|wollt ihr} es nennen?"

