#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/022_salt_for_stormvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The herring came in! So many fish that we have no salt left to keep them. Bring us four crates of "
"salt, quickly, before the catch spoils."
msgstr ""
"Der Hering ist da! So viele Fische, dass wir kein Salz mehr haben, um sie haltbar zu machen. "
"{crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} uns vier Kisten Salz, schnell, bevor der Fang verdirbt."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/022_salt_for_stormvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Four crates! Now we salt the herring in barrels, and nobody goes hungry this winter."
msgstr ""
"Vier Kisten! Jetzt salzen wir den Hering in Fässer ein, und diesen Winter muss niemand hungern."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/022_salt_for_stormvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Salted herring kept for a whole winter; it was the food of the whole north."
msgstr "Salzhering hielt einen ganzen Winter lang; er war das Essen des ganzen Nordens."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/023_charcoal_for_the_smith/mission.json
