#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees for Solby"
msgstr "Bienen für Solby"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My apple trees bloom, but no bee visits them! Without bees, no apples. Buy a beehive from Alfhild "
"in Dimmberga and bring it to my orchard."
msgstr ""
"Meine Apfelbäume blühen, aber keine Biene besucht sie! Ohne Bienen keine Äpfel. "
"{crew|Kauf|Kauf|Kauft} einen Bienenstock bei Alfhild in Dimmberga und {crew|bring|bring|bringt} "
"ihn in meinen Obstgarten."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Listen to them hum! Now the flowers will become apples. Take these flowers for your farm."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Hör|Hör|Hört} nur, wie sie summen! Jetzt werden aus den Blüten Äpfel. {crew|Nimm|Nimm|Nehmt}"
" diese Blumen für {crew|deinen|deinen|euren} Hof."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees carry the pollen from flower to flower, so that the fruits grow."
msgstr "Bienen tragen den Blütenstaub von Blüte zu Blüte, damit die Früchte wachsen."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Lost Lamb"
msgstr "Das verlorene Lamm"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One of the lambs from the cold night is gone! The little one with the black ear. Ask Freya and "
"Liv, they paddle everywhere in their canoe."
msgstr ""
"Eins der Lämmer aus der kalten Nacht ist weg! Das Kleine mit dem schwarzen Ohr. "
"{crew|Frag|Frag|Fragt} Freya und Liv, sie paddeln mit ihrem Kanu überall herum."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A lamb with a black ear? We saw one on Laxön, eating Tova's flowers!"
msgstr ""
"Ein Lamm mit einem schwarzen Ohr? Wir haben eins auf Laxön gesehen, es hat Tovas Blumen gefressen!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She swam over! Can you imagine? She is wet but well. Take her home."
msgstr ""
"Es ist herübergeschwommen! {crew|Stell dir|Stell dir|Stellt euch} das vor! Es ist nass, aber "
"gesund. {crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} es nach Hause."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Black Ear! She runs to her mother. Keep the other lamb of that ewe: she likes you."
msgstr ""
"Schwarzohr! Es läuft zu seiner Mutter. {crew|Behalte|Behalte|Behaltet} das andere Lamm dieses "
"Schafs: Es mag {crew|dich|dich|euch}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Lamb"
msgstr "Lamm"

