#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sheep can swim, but they do not like it: their wool gets heavy."
msgstr "Schafe können schwimmen, aber sie mögen es nicht: Ihre Wolle wird schwer."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Herbs for the Lakes"
msgstr "Kräuter für die Seen"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autumn comes, and the animals catch colds. Take my herbs to those who need them: two bundles to "
"the horse farm, two to the herders, two to Gudrun's inn."
msgstr ""
"Der Herbst kommt, und die Tiere erkälten sich. {crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} meine Kräuter zu denen, "
"die sie brauchen: zwei Bündel zum Pferdehof, zwei zu den Hirten, zwei zu Gudruns Gasthaus."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Herbs from Tova! Now the cow and the calf stay well all winter."
msgstr "Kräuter von Tova! Jetzt bleiben die Kuh und das Kalb den ganzen Winter gesund."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "All delivered? You are real helpers now. Take these herbs for your own animals."
msgstr ""
"Alles ausgeliefert? {crew|Du bist ein echter Helfer|Du bist eine echte Helferin|Ihr seid echte "
"Helfer|Ihr seid echte Helferinnen}. {crew|Nimm|Nimm|Nehmt} diese Kräuter für "
"{crew|deine|deine|eure} eigenen Tiere."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Herbs"
msgstr "Kräuter"

#. a thing of a task; {count|...|...} picks the form for the number {count} (one, then the others;
#. see the Plural-Forms of this file for how many forms your language has), e.g., '{count|a crate of
#. salt|{count} crates of salt}'
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "{count|a bundle of herbs|{count} bundles of herbs}"
msgstr "{count|ein Bündel Kräuter|{count} Bündel Kräuter}"

#. the thing '{count|a bundle of herbs|{count} bundles of herbs}' for {thing@acc} in the
#. translations: the accusative (the direct object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty
#. if it is the same as the plain translation
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
msgctxt "acc"
