#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Healers dried herbs in bundles under the roof, to have them all winter."
msgstr ""
"Heilerinnen trockneten Kräuter in Bündeln unter dem Dach, damit sie den ganzen Winter reichten."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Mill Turns"
msgstr "Die Mühle dreht sich"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The harvest is in, and the mill wheel turns day and night! But the farmers are slow. Bring me six "
"crates of grain to grind."
msgstr ""
"Die Ernte ist eingebracht, und das Mühlrad dreht sich Tag und Nacht! Aber die Bauern sind langsam."
" {crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} mir sechs Kisten Getreide zum Mahlen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Six crates! Listen to the stones grind. Bjarne says hello, and here is your share."
msgstr ""
"Sechs Kisten! {crew|Hör|Hör|Hört} nur, wie die Steine mahlen. Bjarne lässt grüßen, und hier ist "
"{crew|dein|dein|euer} Anteil."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Most vikings ground their grain by hand with two stones; a water mill was a wonder."
msgstr ""
"Die meisten Wikinger mahlten ihr Korn mit zwei Steinen von Hand; eine Wassermühle war ein Wunder."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Henhouse Full"
msgstr "Ein voller Hühnerstall"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eggs sell so well! Let us have six hens. Buy hens at the market in Kråkhamn or the farm of "
"Frosttorp, and bring them home."
msgstr ""
"Eier verkaufen sich so gut! Wir wollen sechs Hühner halten. {crew|Kauf|Kauf|Kauft} Hühner auf dem "
"Markt in Kråkhamn oder auf dem Hof in Frosttorp, und {crew|bring|bring|bringt} sie nach Hause."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Six hens! Cluck, cluck, scratch, scratch. Do not forget: they eat grain."
msgstr ""
"Sechs Hühner! Gack, gack, scharr, scharr. {crew|Vergiss|Vergiss|Vergesst} nicht: Sie fressen "
"Getreide."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking hens were small and laid fewer eggs than ours, but every farm had some."
msgstr ""
"Die Hühner der Wikinger waren klein und legten weniger Eier als unsere, aber jeder Hof hatte "
"welche."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey Cakes"
msgstr "Honigkuchen"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We want to sell honey cakes on the market! But we have no oven. Bring honey and grain to your "
"grandmother; she bakes them overnight, and you bring us the cakes."
msgstr ""
"Wir wollen auf dem Markt Honigkuchen verkaufen! Aber wir haben keinen Ofen. "
"{crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} Honig und Getreide zu {crew|deiner|deiner|eurer} Großmutter; sie backt "
"die Kuchen über Nacht, und {crew|du bringst|du bringst|ihr bringt} sie uns."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey! Now the grain."
msgstr "Honig! Jetzt das Getreide."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I bake them tonight. Come for them in the morning!"
msgstr "Ich backe sie heute Nacht. {crew|Hol|Hol|Holt} sie morgen früh ab!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Still warm. Do not eat them all on the way!"
msgstr "Noch warm. {crew|Iss|Iss|Esst} nicht alle unterwegs auf!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They smell so good! Everybody comes to our stall. Here, half the silver is yours."
msgstr ""
"Die duften so gut! Alle kommen an unseren Stand. Hier, die Hälfte des Silbers gehört "
"{crew|dir|dir|euch}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cakes"
msgstr "Kuchen"

