"Schnatter, schnatter! {crew|Halt|Halt|Haltet} {crew|deine|deine|eure} Mütze fest, {crew|mein "
"Junge|mein Mädchen|ihr zwei|ihr Mädchen}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/048_geese_for_the_market/mission.json
