#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Canoe Race"
msgstr "Das Kanurennen"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Race us! Whoever touches the jetties of Ålberga, Dimmberga and Svanetorp first and comes back here"
" wins. Can you do it before the day ends?"
msgstr ""
"{crew|Fahr|Fahr|Fahrt} mit uns um die Wette! Wer zuerst die Stege von Ålberga, Dimmberga und "
"Svanetorp berührt und hierher zurückkommt, gewinnt. {crew|Schaffst du|Schaffst du|Schafft ihr} "
"das, bevor der Tag zu Ende ist?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ålberga: touched! The canoe is right behind you!"
msgstr "Ålberga: berührt! Das Kanu ist dicht hinter {crew|dir|dir|euch}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dimmberga! Row, row, they are close!"
msgstr "Dimmberga! {crew|Rudere|Rudere|Rudert}, {crew|rudere|rudere|rudert}, sie sind ganz nah!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Svanetorp! Now back to Kråkhamn!"
msgstr "Svanetorp! Jetzt zurück nach Kråkhamn!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You won! But only by a nose. Next time we win! Here, the prize: a honey cake each, and silver."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Du hast|Du hast|Ihr habt} gewonnen! Aber nur um eine Nasenlänge. Nächstes Mal gewinnen wir! "
"Hier ist der Preis: {crew|ein Honigkuchen|ein Honigkuchen|ein Honigkuchen für jeden} und Silber."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vikings loved contests: rowing, swimming, wrestling and running."
msgstr "Die Wikinger liebten Wettkämpfe: Rudern, Schwimmen, Ringen und Laufen."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hild's Wedding"
msgstr "Hilds Hochzeit"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My daughter Hild marries Leif the shepherd! I can forge a sword, but a wedding? Bring four casks "
"of mead from Dimmberga and two crates of cloth for her dress."
msgstr ""
"Meine Tochter Hild heiratet Schäfer Leif! Ich kann ein Schwert schmieden, aber eine Hochzeit? "
"{crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} vier Fässchen Met aus Dimmberga und zwei Kisten Stoff für ihr Kleid."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead! Now the cloth."
msgstr "Met! Jetzt den Stoff."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My sweetest mead, for Hild. Tell her to be happy!"
msgstr "Mein süßester Met, für Hild. {crew|Sag|Sag|Sagt} ihr, sie soll glücklich sein!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Blue cloth for my dress! Father cries, he says it is the smoke. Come to the wedding!"
msgstr ""
"Blauer Stoff für mein Kleid! Vater weint, er sagt, es ist der Rauch. {crew|Komm|Komm|Kommt} zur "
"Hochzeit!"

