#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Swarm"
msgstr "Der Schwarm"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My bees swarmed! A whole cloud of them flew off with a young queen, and Solveig says they hang in "
"her apple tree. Bring them this empty hive, and bring them back to me."
msgstr ""
"Meine Bienen sind ausgeschwärmt! Eine ganze Wolke ist mit einer jungen Königin davongeflogen, und "
"Solveig sagt, sie hängen in ihrem Apfelbaum. {crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} ihnen diesen leeren "
"Bienenstock, und {crew|bring|bring|bringt} sie mir zurück."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They hang there like a big brown pear! Hold the hive under them... shake... they are in!"
msgstr ""
"Da hängen sie wie eine große braune Birne! Den Bienenstock darunter halten ... schütteln ... sie "
"sind drin!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My bees! Not one sting for you? Then they like you. Take two crates of honey."
msgstr ""
"Meine Bienen! Kein einziger Stich? Dann mögen sie {crew|dich|dich|euch}. {crew|Nimm|Nimm|Nehmt} "
"zwei Kisten Honig."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Row smoothly: a swarm is calm, as long as nobody bumps the hive."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Rudere|Rudere|Rudert} ruhig: Ein Schwarm bleibt friedlich, solange niemand an den "
"Bienenstock stößt."

