#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Chieftain's Horse"
msgstr "Das Pferd des Häuptlings"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My horse Grane will not eat, and he is sad. Bring Tova to look at him, and take her home after."
msgstr ""
"Mein Pferd Grane will nicht fressen, und es ist traurig. {crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} Tova her, damit"
" sie es ansieht, und {crew|bring|bring|bringt} sie danach nach Hause."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tova: Just as I thought: a sore tooth. I file it smooth... There. Let him rest a night."
msgstr ""
"Tova: Genau wie ich dachte: ein schmerzender Zahn. Ich feile ihn glatt ... So. "
"{crew|Lass|Lass|Lasst} es eine Nacht ruhen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not eating? Let me see his teeth."
msgstr "Es frisst nicht? Dann sehe ich mir mal seine Zähne an."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Back on my island. You were good assistants: soon you heal on your own."
msgstr ""
"Zurück auf meiner Insel. {crew|Du warst ein guter Helfer|Du warst eine gute Helferin|Ihr wart gute"
" Helfer|Ihr wart gute Helferinnen}: Bald {crew|heilst du|heilst du|heilt ihr} allein."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grane eats like a wolf again! Take Tova home, with my thanks."
msgstr ""
"Grane frisst wieder wie ein Wolf! {crew|Bring|Bring|Bringt} Tova nach Hause, mit meinem Dank."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Horses' teeth grow all their life; sometimes they must be filed smooth."
msgstr "Pferdezähne wachsen ihr ganzes Leben lang; manchmal muss man sie glatt feilen."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
