#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ducklings"
msgstr "Die Entenküken"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We found seven ducklings in Stormvik harbour, without their mother! Grim says a duck with no "
"ducklings swims sadly in his swan cove. Can you bring them to her?"
msgstr ""
"Wir haben im Hafen von Stormvik sieben Entenküken gefunden, ohne ihre Mutter! Grim sagt, in seiner"
" Schwanenbucht schwimmt eine traurige Ente ohne Küken. {crew|Kannst du|Kannst du|Könnt ihr} sie zu"
" ihr bringen?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look: the duck swims to them, and they all paddle after her in a line. Seven! Ha!"
msgstr ""
"{crew|Schau|Schau|Schaut}: Die Ente schwimmt zu ihnen, und alle paddeln ihr in einer Reihe "
"hinterher. Sieben! Ha!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Peep, peep! They are in a basket with some straw. Hurry!"
msgstr "Piep, piep! Sie sitzen in einem Korb mit etwas Stroh. Schnell!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They found their mother? Hooray! You are the best."
msgstr ""
"Sie haben ihre Mutter gefunden? Hurra! {crew|Du bist der Beste|Du bist die Beste|Ihr seid die "
"Besten|Ihr seid die Besten}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ducklings"
msgstr "Entenküken"

