#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/076_a_wedding_at_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "In the boat with the dragon head! Everybody will look at me."
msgstr "Im Boot mit dem Drachenkopf! Alle werden mich ansehen."

