#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Healers' Round"
msgstr "Die Runde der Heiler"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are ready. Do my round alone today: look at the lambs in Ålberga, the horses in Torsgården and"
" the swans in Svanetorp. Then come and tell me."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Du bist|Du bist|Ihr seid} bereit. {crew|Mach|Mach|Macht} heute meine Runde allein: "
"{crew|sieh|sieh|seht} nach den Lämmern in Ålberga, den Pferden in Torsgården und den Schwänen in "
"Svanetorp. Dann {crew|komm|komm|kommt} und {crew|erzähl|erzähl|erzählt} es mir."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "You look in their eyes, their ears, their hooves... All well? Good! They like you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Du schaust|Du schaust|Ihr schaut} ihnen in die Augen, in die Ohren, auf die Hufe ... Alles "
"gut? Schön! Sie mögen {crew|dich|dich|euch}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bror is old, but well. Silke's new foal is strong. Tell Tova all is fine."
msgstr ""
"Bror ist alt, aber gesund. Silkes neues Fohlen ist kräftig. {crew|Sag|Sag|Sagt} Tova, alles ist "
"gut."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The swans? Fat and happy. One has a sore wing: you wrapped it well."
msgstr ""
"Die Schwäne? Dick und zufrieden. Einer hat einen verletzten Flügel: {crew|Du hast|Du hast|Ihr "
"habt} ihn gut verbunden."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All well, and the swan's wing wrapped? Then take this: your own healer's bag. You are healers now."
msgstr ""
"Alles gut, und der Flügel des Schwans verbunden? Dann {crew|nimm|nimm|nehmt} das hier: {crew|deine"
" eigene Heilertasche|deine eigene Heilertasche|eure eigene Heilertasche}. {crew|Du bist|Du "
"bist|Ihr seid} jetzt {crew|Heiler|Heilerin|Heiler|Heilerinnen}."

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "your own healer's bag"
msgstr "eine eigene Heilertasche"

