#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At a feast, the host gave the best food and drink: being generous brought honour."
msgstr "Auf einem Fest gab der Gastgeber das beste Essen und Trinken: Großzügigkeit brachte Ehre."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
