#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The guests come! But some have no boat: bring Old Grim from Svanetorp, Old Halvard from Solby, and"
" Tova from her island. Then the feast begins!"
msgstr ""
"Die Gäste kommen! Aber manche haben kein Boot: {crew|Hol|Hol|Holt} den alten Grim aus Svanetorp, "
"den alten Halvard aus Solby und Tova von ihrer Insel. Dann beginnt das Fest!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
